contentText:
Aaron Rowe, one of Ed Sheeran &#8216;s openers on his U.S. tour, has dropped out of the trek in solidarity with Macklemore &#8212; who was dismissed from the tour due to his &#8220;Free Palestine&#8221; messaging on stage &#8212; and the countless people in Gaza who are suffering.

